"1.6.0. (`502177f3c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/502177f3c>`__, `32dc31962 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/32dc31962>`__, `a175bff39 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a175bff39>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Priloženi ugrađeni program (firmware):** ažuriran na 1.7.0 pa zatim na "
"1.8.0 za obje ploče ``OMV2`` i ``OMV7``\\ ; minimalna/kompatibilna verzija "
"ugrađenog programa pokretača (bootloader) je 1.6.0. (\\ `502177f3c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/502177f3c>`__\\ , `32dc31962 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/32dc31962>`__\\ , `a175bff39 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a175bff39>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v1.1.0.rst:152
